{
  "_comment": "C1 shared fixture: one real client frame per ClientAction (the NARROWED human-initiated set). Source of truth for the action strings is apps/desktop/src/contracts.ts (ClientCommand union — the client-sendable subset of UiCommand); shapes are what apps/desktop/src/store.ts dispatchCommand emits. Server-originated commands (notification.show, media.state, tts.speak, audio.play) are NOT client frames — they stay in the full UiCommand union for the server->client channel only. Both sides must stay in sync: tests/python/test_client_actions.py parses every frame through parse_client_message and fails if any declared ClientAction lacks an authoritative handler (R39); apps/desktop/tests/client-actions.test.ts asserts every TS ClientCommand action string has an entry here. Never regenerate by hand on one side only.",
